.expo/
**/.expo/
# Native folders made by `expo prebuild`, at the repo root and one level down
# (app-mobile/ios, mingla-business/android, ...). Anchored on purpose: a bare
# `ios/` or `**/ios/` also drops modules/*/ios, so local Expo modules vanish
# from EAS builds (#4389: Tap to Pay hidden on every iPhone in 1.3.0).
/ios/
/android/
/*/ios/
/*/android/
dist/
web-build/
**/web-build/
